Twist Hacking Guide
====================

Copyright (C) 2026 Chris Burdess

Development
-----------

Twist uses:
  - quickstep library (../quickstep) for QUIC and TLS
  - GNU readline for interactive input

No other dependencies may be added without explicit approval.

Building
--------

  ./bootstrap
  ./configure --with-quickstep=../quickstep
  make

Contributing
------------

See INSTALL for build requirements.

All contributions must follow GPLv3+ licensing.
